<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h734ab279gfdf3g2bf6gfe31g1ceafec615e0">火遁·豪火球之术</content>
	<content contentuid="h694401a7g9adag4a76gc386g74170f3d80f6">从口中喷出巨大的火球，撞击后爆炸，灼烧范围内的一切。</content>
	<content contentuid="h248c813eg26a8gaba3g72d3gc9a5dd682489">凤仙火</content>
	<content contentuid="ha50fea58g3566g23dfgdf0ag57b399ad6c21">从口中喷出如凤仙花般散开的数团火焰，覆盖面前的扇形区域。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbc1ac940g9042g1437g0ed0ge41d34eda447">天照</content>
	<content contentuid="h30f4b04eg72a3gb164g693agd2f853f13e65">黑色的不灭之炎，燃尽一切。目标区域燃起诅咒之火，黑炎持续吞噬敌人，直到其灰飞烟灭。</content>
	<content contentuid="h65e7acacgdfc1gb161g27aag2905b95fffdc">水遁·水龙弹之术</content>
	<content contentuid="h514138bcgee4cg6684gae54g44364df181a5">以查克拉凝成水龙，冲击目标并使其湿透。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc899709dg3c2dg23c2ga0ecgff3b2bbcf825">水铁炮</content>
	<content contentuid="hbaa23d3fg7c6bg1ef2ge8cfgd6ff4644333e">以指尖弹射高压水弹，冲击并击湿目标，浇灭火焰。</content>
	<content contentuid="h20c61c8dg592dg572bgb488g040b52b79442">雾隐之术</content>
	<content contentuid="hfaf7eecegc603g9d13g9026g2bf53d0759ad">制造浓雾遮蔽视线，使敌人陷入失明。</content>
	<content contentuid="h37fda7f5geebag0310g7d46g0226c9ab6358">雷遁·雷切</content>
	<content contentuid="h78f11df6g2b41g6ae6g74a6g84ed1e52582f">将雷属性查克拉集中于手，以迅雷之势突进贯穿目标。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0c2e90f3g4f06gf5fegf7c2gcea6727d3d74">千鸟</content>
	<content contentuid="hfc973b6eg148fg2f6dg99cag60a1734004ef">将雷遁查克拉凝聚于手，如千鸟齐鸣般疾冲突进，贯穿目标。雷切的雏形，更快更轻。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1d668589g57dbg4e9ag06bfg0aa1c95c3f6d">麒麟</content>
	<content contentuid="hec714df7gcb73g3b08g9895g6e7c5ba1fc61">引动天雷凝聚成麒麟之姿轰然降下，在大范围内释放毁灭性的雷电。</content>
	<content contentuid="h375b35f9g9badgedb3g465bgc0f1a8aa96cf">风遁·大突破</content>
	<content contentuid="h3e039cb2g4364g6b60ge134gd652f06177e0">深吸一口气喷出狂风，击退面前的敌人。</content>
	<content contentuid="h62dd3ddfgc8e5g7a48g7552g52d6e02782fd">螺旋丸</content>
	<content contentuid="hb4cddbb1gfc52g78b7ge40bg614e0edb1b67">将旋转的查克拉凝聚于掌心的球形气弹，近身轰击目标并击飞。</content>
	<content contentuid="hab302a6dg5723g1666gcb5eg34a49426dcd6">螺旋手里剑</content>
	<content contentuid="hd8e04468g504dgff48gf766g02c9c01f01c9">将螺旋丸化为巨型旋转手里剑掷出，命中后爆开，绞杀大片敌人。</content>
	<content contentuid="h7b38b0c0g8824gb959g41c5gfdf0d818ab94">土遁·土隆枪</content>
	<content contentuid="h6814a784g5fa0g904egd930g8de8319e27fd">令大地隆起尖锐的石枪，从脚下贯穿目标。</content>
	<content contentuid="hcb1d02cegf281g8bf1g7e17g24c0b217b936">砂暴</content>
	<content contentuid="hc211460eg54d4gf950g0177g21f1dc53816d">卷起漫天砂尘笼罩区域，将地面化为流沙，令敌人寸步难行。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2a8e0e8fg727eg7c19gc751gaf997318ea2f">写轮眼</content>
	<content contentuid="h398d765agc0e1g25d4g9a45g705f16433348">瞳力全开，预判敌人的一切动作，提升暴击与闪避。</content>
	<content contentuid="h4fa0a620gc97dg0405g2f6bga2b5888e6b88">万花筒写轮眼</content>
	<content contentuid="h3cc1197dga710gcc5ag762dgdda7bae2bf82">更高层次的瞳力，眼中的世界已然不同，大幅提升暴击与闪避。</content>
	<content contentuid="h029b896ag425ag9366g1304g0ca8c394bfc1">月读</content>
	<content contentuid="h8b723b88g2055g949ag40f1g0473e1bd0c52">将敌人拉入幻术世界，在精神世界中将其囚禁，现实中则冻结其身心。</content>
	<content contentuid="h497bcaadgae82g83a8ga10cgf933686c2f8a">神威</content>
	<content contentuid="hfc948893ga445g7543g60a3gdc83efc7aa1b">扭曲空间，将目标卷入异空间后从高空掷落，坠落造成重创。</content>
	<content contentuid="h220fc7c7ge417g4f33g209dg6fe3ef181a9d">别天神</content>
	<content contentuid="h9d6576bcgcd5eg3c8dg3f86g20add11b7829">以无声的瞳力支配敌人的精神，将敌人化为己方战力。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc0382ad2g0ad0g2a5dg21dfgf7df26a9b7fa">须佐能乎</content>
	<content contentuid="h831b436fg8590geb46gc72eg915f7f5e5135">召唤巨大的查克拉化身，庇护自身并碾压敌人。</content>
	<content contentuid="h57a8e183gb0bag2b94g56b2ge0baa2761a0c">手里剑</content>
	<content contentuid="heaafc2b7g40f4g4335gde9bg81ff43b3fd6d">掷出手里剑，以极快的速度精准攻击单个目标。</content>
	<content contentuid="h352a6675g84cbgd843ga010gf037721c6cc4">瞬身术</content>
	<content contentuid="h1124d506g39efgb845ge235gb3016857003d">以惊人速度瞬间移动至目标位置，用于位移与突袭。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2a8e0e8fg727eg7c19gc751gaf997318ea2f">写轮眼</content>
	<content contentuid="hfbe2c4bbg4a44gfe29g4193g7672f3b1331c">预判敌人的动作：暴击 +5%，闪避 +5%。</content>
	<content contentuid="h4fa0a620gc97dg0405g2f6bga2b5888e6b88">万花筒写轮眼</content>
	<content contentuid="hdf14b8dbga16bg34c3g5c70g945b43f971b7">更深的瞳力：暴击 +10%，闪避 +10%。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbc1ac940g9042g1437g0ed0ge41d34eda447">天照</content>
	<content contentuid="hb8ab7ab0gf763gf930ge71cg21925b0fd9a5">黑色不灭之炎缠绕周身，每回合吞噬生命。</content>
</contentList>
